; Asuka, Black Hole's intelligence chief: "Bassline Protocol" (take G), a bass-and-timpani groove in A Phrygian-minor at 120 beats a minute.
; Original composition for tangoAW2. A chopped, syncopated two-bar bass riff on the sixteenth grid (rests and accents make the groove) with a low brass answering on the off beats,
; kick on the beats and snare on 2 and 4, a short two-bar brass hook beneath the bass in the mix, her clock as a few ticks on top.
; Form: intro (bass and timpani), A (the hook, repeated, varied), B (a rising second phrase over a climbing bass), BR (bass and timpani only), R (the full return, the low brass doubling the hook), C (a step up, then home).

song asuka
tempo 120
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst lead    = A.56  shift=-12
inst low     = A.111 shift=-12
inst bass    = A.36  shift=24
inst clock   = A.117 shift=0
inst kit     = A.120
inst timp    = A.47  shift=24
hit kick=36 rim=37 snare=40 hat=44 ohat=46 tom1=45 tom2=48 tom3=50 crash=49

track 1 inst=lead    vol=80 pan=0   vel=108 gate=85 gain=0.9
track 2 inst=low     vol=72 pan=-14 vel=110 gate=75 gain=1.0
track 3 inst=clock   vol=50 pan=20  vel=96  gate=50 gain=1.0
track 4 inst=bass    vol=100 pan=0  vel=120 gate=78 gain=2.2
track 5 inst=kit     vol=72 pan=0   vel=108 gate=100 gain=0.7
track 6 inst=timp    vol=84 pan=0   vel=122 gate=92 gain=1.4

def dc:
  | crash/16 hat/16 hat/16 kick/16 snare/16 hat/16 hat/16 hat/16 kick/16 hat/16 kick/16 hat/16 snare/16 hat/16 hat/16 ohat/16 |
end
def f:
  | kick/16 hat/16 hat/16 kick/16 snare/16 hat/16 hat/16 hat/16 tom1/16 tom1/16 tom2/16 tom2/16 tom3/16 tom3/16 snare/16 snare/16 |
end
def fr:
  | snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 |
end
def fb:
  | tom1/16 tom1/16 tom1/16 tom1/16 tom2/16 tom2/16 tom2/16 tom2/16 tom3/16 tom3/16 tom3/16 tom3/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 snare/16 |
end
def rs:
  | r/1 |
end
def r1:
  | A1/16 A1/16 r/16 A1/16 r/16 A1/16 Bb1/16 r/16 A1/8 r/16 A1/16 C2/16 r/16 Bb1/16 A1/16 |
end
def r2:
  | A1/16 r/16 A1/16 A1/16 r/16 E2/16 r/16 A1/16 A2/8 G2/16 r/16 E2/16 Bb1/16 r/16 A1/16 |
end
def h1:
  | A4/8. A4/16 C5/8 Bb4/8 A4/4 r/8 E4/8 |
end
def h2:
  | A4/8. A4/16 C5/8 E5/8 D5/4 C5/4 |
end
def hv:
  | Bb4/8. Bb4/16 D5/8 C5/8 Bb4/4 E5/4 |
end
def c1:
  | E5/8. E5/16 D5/8 C5/8 Bb4/8 A4/8 Bb4/8 C5/8 |
end
def c2:
  | D5/8 C5/8 Bb4/4 A4/2 |
end
def lo1:
  | A3/8 r/8 r/4 A3/8 r/8 Bb3/8 r/8 |
end
def lo2:
  | A3/16 r/16 A3/16 r/16 A3/16 r/16 A3/16 r/16 r/2 |
end
def sA:
  | A3/1 |
end
def sB:
  | Bb3/1 |
end
def ck:
  | r/4 E6/16 r/16 r/8 r/4 E6/16 r/16 r/8 |
end
def tb:
  | A1/4 r/4 A1/4 r/4 |
end
def tr:
  | A1/8 A1/8 A1/8 A1/8 A1/8 A1/8 A1/8 A1/8 |
end
def d1:
  | kick/16 hat/16 hat/16 kick/16 snare/16 hat/16 hat/16 hat/16 kick/16 hat/16 kick/16 hat/16 snare/16 hat/16 hat/16 ohat/16 |
end
def d2:
  | kick/16 hat/16 hat/16 hat/16 snare/16 hat/16 kick/16 hat/16 kick/16 hat/16 hat/16 kick/16 snare/16 hat/16 hat/16 hat/16 |
end

section intro bars=2
  1: @rs*2
  2: @rs*2
  3: @rs*2
  4: @r1 @r2
  5: @rs*2
  6: @tb @tb
end

section A bars=8
  1: @h1 @h2 @h1 @h2 @h1 @h2 @h1 @hv
  2: @lo1 @lo2 @lo1 @lo2 @lo1 @lo2 @lo1 @lo2
  3: @ck*8
  4: @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2
  5: @dc @d2 @d1 @f @d1 @d2 @d1 @f
  6: @tb*8
end

section B bars=8
  1: @c1 @c2 @c1 @c2 @c1+3 @c2+3 @c1+5 @c2+5
  2: @lo1 @lo2 @lo1 @lo2 @lo1 @lo2 @lo1 @lo2
  3: @ck*8
  4: @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2 @r1+3 @r2+3 @r1+5 @r2+5
  5: @d2 @d1 @d2 @f @d2 @d1 @d2 @f
  6: @tb*8
end

section BR bars=4
  1: @rs*4
  2: @rs*4
  3: @rs*4
  4: @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2
  5: @rs @rs @rs @fb
  6: {vol 70>115/384} @tr*4
end

section R bars=8
  1: @h1 @h2 @h1 @h2 @h1 @h2 @h1 @hv
  2: @h1-12 @h2-12 @h1-12 @h2-12 @h1-12 @h2-12 @h1-12 @hv-12
  3: @ck*8
  4: @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2 @r1 @r2
  5: @dc @d2 @d1 @f @dc @d2 @d1 @f
  6: @tb*8
end

section C bars=8
  1: @h1+2 @h2+2 @h1+2 @hv+2 @c1+2 @c2+2 @h1 @hv
  2: @lo1+2 @lo2+2 @lo1+2 @lo2+2 @lo1+2 @lo2+2 @lo1 @lo2
  3: @ck+2 @ck+2 @ck+2 @ck+2 @ck+2 @ck+2 @ck @ck
  4: @r1+2 @r2+2 @r1+2 @r2+2 @r1+2 @r2+2 @r1 @r2
  5: @dc @d2 @d1 @f @d2 @d1 @d2 @fr
  6: @tb+2 @tb+2 @tb+2 @tb+2 @tb+2 @tb+2 @tb @tb
end

form intro loop A B BR R C
